xnu 0155: mondrianfb_fps=1 logs the swap rate once a second

The UI is drawn by the CPU, so the frame rate is the number that moves
when the renderer or the CPU clock changes. The vsync timer already runs
at the panel rate; count the swaps and print the difference every second.
Off by default: it is a measurement, not a feature.
 
